    "detailed_description": "Mongolia is a nation on horseback. People here have the talents that can shoot good at ride, and it is not so easy to become Zhebie, but at least it can hit the target on the horse's back.<br><br>This is a VR ride -shooting virtual game. Zhe is the highest title of Mongolia to the shooter. If you want to be the strongest existence in the shooter, it must be your ultimate goal.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112930/extras/d1bb6385316a21e5cd05cd85940657ba.avif?t=1679377827\" /></div><br> <br>In the game, the player will play a brave Mongolian shooter, riding a fast horse around multiple arrow targets in the middle, through the VR handle, the player's wrist, elbow and shoulder movement, complete the archery bow, the bow bow, Aiming and archery simulation. Players need to adjust their posture and angle, and accurately aim at the target, and then complete the bow strings, shoot arrows, and hit the center of the center.<br><br>Through virtual technology, the game allows players to feel the real immediately archery experience. Challenge your limits and show your most perfect archery skills. Note that Zhebei will not let the bow and arrows get out of the target heart again and again!<br><br>If you have a good heart and want to try to be a god shooter, try this game to challenge your archery skills.<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2112930/extras/763e5ab9cc9a38f93d9f3242f31406d9.avif?t=1679377827\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game operation:</h2>The left handle controls the bow of the bow and arrow<br>Press the trigger button of the right handle to drag the bow string of the bow and arrow<br>Loose the trigger key of the right handle to shoot the bow and arrow",
